Next:
  · labels: docker compose -p warden-turnkey-gw exec warden-gateway npx -y --package=/pkg/aimarket-warden-0.30.0.tgz warden-mcp gateway labels --config /etc/warden/gateway.json lists the tools chats used without a label; add them to state/flow-policy.json ("outbound", "destructive", "private", "untrusted"), no restart needed;
  · pilot: two weeks in "audit", then "mode": "deny" in state/flow-policy.json; the decision log for the numbers is in state/ (wouldRefuse = a call deny would stop);
  · undo: warden-mcp openwebui undo --url http://127.0.0.1:18090 --dir <work>/warden-openwebui

